This separation is the whole architecture
Operation
"What are the local gradients?"
        │
        ▼
Autograd Engine
"Where should they go, and what runs next?"
        │
        ▼
Tensor
"Store my accumulated gradient."



Compare that with v1:

Value._backward()
    ↓
calculate gradient
    ↓
modify parents



In v2:

Add.backward()
    ↓
calculate gradients
    ↓
return them

Engine
    ↓
accumulate them
    ↓
continue traversal